1
00:00:08,519 --> 00:00:09,039
Your Majesty,

2
00:00:09,640 --> 00:00:11,199
Lady Xiao fled to the grassland

3
00:00:11,519 --> 00:00:13,000
and sought refuge in the Hulian clan.

4
00:00:13,679 --> 00:00:14,960
The Great Chanyu held a banquet in her honor,

5
00:00:15,240 --> 00:00:16,079
treating her as an honored guest.

6
00:00:16,399 --> 00:00:17,559
This is tantamount to treason.

7
00:00:18,199 --> 00:00:19,719
I suggest we immediately arrest

8
00:00:19,960 --> 00:00:21,519
the remaining members of the Xiao clan in the capital.

9
00:00:23,039 --> 00:00:24,839
Xiao Yunshang is a treacherous woman.

10
00:00:25,679 --> 00:00:26,519
The entire Xiao clan

11
00:00:27,480 --> 00:00:28,280
should be wiped out!

12
00:00:28,359 --> 00:00:29,039
Your Majesty,

13
00:00:29,559 --> 00:00:31,559
some members of the Xiao clan are loyal to the Emperor.

14
00:00:31,760 --> 00:00:32,679
If we indiscriminately execute them,

15
00:00:33,079 --> 00:00:33,719
it may be inappropriate.

16
00:00:33,840 --> 00:00:35,039
Xiao Yunshang betrayed the empire.

17
00:00:35,119 --> 00:00:36,240
If we don't kill the rest of them,

18
00:00:36,520 --> 00:00:37,320
what are we waiting for?

19
00:00:37,520 --> 00:00:38,280
You know nothing.

20
00:00:38,399 --> 00:00:39,920
You only know how to kill.

21
00:00:39,960 --> 00:00:40,560
Is it fun?

22
00:00:40,719 --> 00:00:41,159
Enough!

23
00:00:42,679 --> 00:00:43,920
Xiao Yunshang has been killed.

24
00:00:44,719 --> 00:00:45,119
As for the rest,

25
00:00:45,520 --> 00:00:46,320
I'd rather kill them by mistake

26
00:00:46,679 --> 00:00:47,320
than let them go.

27
00:00:50,039 --> 00:00:51,000
The late Emperor's funeral is not over.

28
00:00:51,359 --> 00:00:52,520
If we kill them now,

29
00:00:52,759 --> 00:00:54,240
what will people say?

30
00:00:55,240 --> 00:00:56,320
The case can be thoroughly investigated,

31
00:00:56,359 --> 00:00:57,280
but we must avoid arbitrary killings.

32
00:00:57,799 --> 00:00:59,000
Your Majesty, I suggest we wait for

33
00:00:59,000 --> 00:01:00,200
the joint investigation of the Ministry of Justice

34
00:01:00,200 --> 00:01:01,079
and the Supreme Court to conclude.

35
00:01:01,920 --> 00:01:02,479
What if I

36
00:01:03,600 --> 00:01:04,719
insist on killing them?

37
00:01:11,000 --> 00:01:12,400
I was just joking.

38
00:01:13,000 --> 00:01:14,159
As you wish.

39
00:01:14,799 --> 00:01:16,400
You may go now.

40
00:01:17,200 --> 00:01:17,799
Yes.

41
00:01:28,640 --> 00:01:29,840
This is a matter of life and death.

42
00:01:30,000 --> 00:01:31,159
How can you treat it as a trivial matter?

43
00:01:32,599 --> 00:01:33,640
Why are you being so serious?

44
00:01:34,359 --> 00:01:36,439
As long as you ask,

45
00:01:36,879 --> 00:01:37,920
I'll agree to anything.

46
00:01:40,000 --> 00:01:40,519
Besides,

47
00:01:41,079 --> 00:01:42,079
Gu Jiachen

48
00:01:42,439 --> 00:01:43,519
isn't coming back.

49
00:01:50,200 --> 00:01:51,640
Our bet

50
00:01:52,760 --> 00:01:54,319
is still up in the air.

51
00:02:19,240 --> 00:02:20,240
How could this happen?

52
00:02:22,080 --> 00:02:23,599
Don't waste your energy anymore.

53
00:02:24,199 --> 00:02:25,280
He's already gone.

54
00:02:25,879 --> 00:02:27,319
Who can you bring back?

55
00:02:29,960 --> 00:02:30,879
Gu Jiachen's soul

56
00:02:30,879 --> 00:02:32,000
has been declining.

57
00:02:32,960 --> 00:02:34,520
He's already at the end of his tether.

58
00:02:35,319 --> 00:02:36,199
This appearance

59
00:02:36,560 --> 00:02:37,840
is purely a last-ditch effort.

60
00:02:38,800 --> 00:02:39,360
Feng Zhiwei,

61
00:02:40,439 --> 00:02:41,719
I have no need to deceive you.

62
00:02:52,360 --> 00:02:52,879
Ye Xuan.

63
00:02:54,280 --> 00:02:54,960
Ye Xuan.

64
00:02:57,080 --> 00:02:57,960
Speak quickly.

65
00:03:02,400 --> 00:03:03,199
The late Emperor has passed away,

66
00:03:03,319 --> 00:03:04,319
and Xiao Yunshang is on the run.

67
00:03:04,560 --> 00:03:06,080
The court needs a stable new Emperor

68
00:03:06,080 --> 00:03:07,120
to reassure the people.

69
00:03:08,159 --> 00:03:10,360
Can you temporarily impersonate Gu Jiachen?

70
00:03:11,439 --> 00:03:13,120
This throne is mine by right.

71
00:03:13,800 --> 00:03:14,840
Do you think I need

72
00:03:14,879 --> 00:03:15,960
to play the fool

73
00:03:16,240 --> 00:03:18,039
to keep the throne?

74
00:03:19,240 --> 00:03:19,960
Feng Zhiwei,

75
00:03:21,560 --> 00:03:23,520
you're not using me as a stand-in, are you?

76
00:03:24,439 --> 00:03:26,560
Not a stand-in, but a partner.

77
00:03:28,800 --> 00:03:29,280
Over the years,

78
00:03:30,240 --> 00:03:30,840
you haven't really

79
00:03:30,919 --> 00:03:31,719
read any memorials, have you?

80
00:03:32,960 --> 00:03:34,039
How many officials in the court?

81
00:03:34,080 --> 00:03:35,039
How many troops in the country?

82
00:03:35,080 --> 00:03:35,599
Do you know?

83
00:03:37,000 --> 00:03:37,479
Ye Xuan,

84
00:03:38,080 --> 00:03:38,759
I can help you,

85
00:03:39,120 --> 00:03:40,080
and Shen Li will too.

86
00:03:41,080 --> 00:03:42,080
When you have the whole court

87
00:03:42,120 --> 00:03:42,879
in your hands,

88
00:03:43,840 --> 00:03:44,759
you can decide how to

89
00:03:44,840 --> 00:03:45,639
govern the country.

90
00:03:48,199 --> 00:03:48,680
Good.

91
00:03:49,439 --> 00:03:50,120
You agreed?

92
00:03:50,800 --> 00:03:51,879
Yes, I agreed.

93
00:03:53,599 --> 00:03:54,800
But I have a condition.

94
00:03:58,400 --> 00:03:59,159
Three months.

95
00:04:01,000 --> 00:04:01,479
What?

96
00:04:02,719 --> 00:04:03,639
If I can

97
00:04:04,719 --> 00:04:05,759
take control of the court

98
00:04:05,800 --> 00:04:06,759
on my own in three months,

99
00:04:09,199 --> 00:04:10,800
you will be my empress.

100
00:04:12,039 --> 00:04:12,639
What's wrong?

101
00:04:13,240 --> 00:04:14,199
An emperor needs

102
00:04:14,199 --> 00:04:14,840
a queen.

103
00:04:15,400 --> 00:04:16,199
I don't have to

104
00:04:16,279 --> 00:04:16,959
pick you,

105
00:04:19,879 --> 00:04:20,959
but you're the best choice.

106
00:04:26,120 --> 00:04:26,560
Fine,

107
00:04:27,480 --> 00:04:28,000
I'll take the bet.

108
00:04:28,680 --> 00:04:30,240
The bet between you and me...

109
00:05:38,319 --> 00:05:38,759
No,

110
00:05:39,600 --> 00:05:40,120
wait!

111
00:05:40,920 --> 00:05:41,319
Don't go!

112
00:05:41,759 --> 00:05:42,279
Gu Jiachen,

113
00:05:52,160 --> 00:05:52,959
I dreamt of you again.

114
00:05:54,160 --> 00:05:55,600
You left me with this mess

115
00:05:55,920 --> 00:05:57,120
and just disappeared.

116
00:05:57,839 --> 00:05:58,920
If I ever find you again,

117
00:05:59,319 --> 00:05:59,720
I'll...

118
00:06:03,600 --> 00:06:04,199
My Lady,

119
00:06:06,519 --> 00:06:07,399
His Highness

120
00:06:07,639 --> 00:06:08,720
has left the palace again.

121
00:06:12,439 --> 00:06:12,920
Understood.

122
00:06:13,720 --> 00:06:14,920
I'll go bring him back.

123
00:06:27,720 --> 00:06:29,079
Where have you been all night?

124
00:06:30,639 --> 00:06:31,120
Just a walk.

125
00:06:31,800 --> 00:06:33,319
A walk to the household minister's home?

126
00:06:34,199 --> 00:06:34,920
And you even

127
00:06:34,959 --> 00:06:36,199
robbed his personal treasury?

128
00:06:38,439 --> 00:06:39,160
That old man

129
00:06:39,160 --> 00:06:40,439
cries poor at every court meeting,

130
00:06:40,800 --> 00:06:42,360
saying the treasury is empty, and then...

131
00:06:42,360 --> 00:06:43,160
So you took

132
00:06:43,160 --> 00:06:44,439
his personal property

133
00:06:44,519 --> 00:06:45,480
to turn it over to the state?

134
00:06:47,839 --> 00:06:48,639
You women

135
00:06:48,680 --> 00:06:49,879
just don't know how to be flexible.

136
00:06:50,680 --> 00:06:51,480
That old man's family

137
00:06:51,480 --> 00:06:52,120
is very rich.

138
00:06:52,639 --> 00:06:53,759
All the valuables

139
00:06:53,879 --> 00:06:55,040
are kept in a set of chests.

140
00:06:55,560 --> 00:06:56,079
Maybe

141
00:06:56,519 --> 00:06:57,519
he's just waiting for me to take them.

142
00:06:58,720 --> 00:06:59,680
Is there a red silk ribbon

143
00:07:00,000 --> 00:07:01,319
tied around the chests?

144
00:07:03,959 --> 00:07:05,000
Could it be

145
00:07:05,319 --> 00:07:06,759
her daughter's dowry?

146
00:07:09,000 --> 00:07:10,000
His wife passed away early,

147
00:07:10,560 --> 00:07:11,439
and he only has this daughter.

148
00:07:11,920 --> 00:07:12,800
He's been saving this money

149
00:07:12,800 --> 00:07:13,959
for 40 years as an official.

150
00:07:14,240 --> 00:07:15,759
His daughter will be married next spring.

151
00:07:16,079 --> 00:07:17,240
If you rob him,

152
00:07:17,360 --> 00:07:18,319
how can his daughter get married?

153
00:07:22,399 --> 00:07:23,519
I didn't know before,

154
00:07:24,319 --> 00:07:25,160
but I'll return it now.

155
00:07:25,639 --> 00:07:26,000
Wait!

156
00:07:26,959 --> 00:07:27,439
And these.

157
00:07:30,759 --> 00:07:31,439
Your Highness,

158
00:07:32,000 --> 00:07:32,759
Lady Feng also took

159
00:07:32,759 --> 00:07:33,879
the money

160
00:07:34,120 --> 00:07:35,160
you robbed from other places.

161
00:07:36,360 --> 00:07:37,120
Send them back together.

162
00:07:39,120 --> 00:07:40,000
Feng Zhiwei,

163
00:07:40,720 --> 00:07:41,839
you're ruthless.

164
00:07:46,560 --> 00:07:47,879
Don't stare at me.

165
00:07:48,360 --> 00:07:48,879
I'll

166
00:07:49,439 --> 00:07:50,199
send the money back.

167
00:07:57,920 --> 00:07:59,319
What happened tonight is just a small matter.

168
00:07:59,959 --> 00:08:00,759
What's important next

169
00:08:00,800 --> 00:08:01,959
is the audience with the Western envoy.

170
00:08:02,959 --> 00:08:03,959
I'll look up some information later.

171
00:08:04,480 --> 00:08:05,519
I have to go to him again.

172
00:08:07,839 --> 00:08:08,319
Lady Feng,

173
00:08:08,959 --> 00:08:10,439
do we really have no other way

174
00:08:10,800 --> 00:08:11,680
to bring back

175
00:08:11,680 --> 00:08:12,279
the previous Prince?

176
00:08:18,879 --> 00:08:19,680
Since childhood,

177
00:08:19,720 --> 00:08:20,759
he has been learning the art of governance,

178
00:08:21,519 --> 00:08:22,360
able to stabilize the country internally

179
00:08:22,879 --> 00:08:23,560
and defeat enemies externally.

180
00:08:24,560 --> 00:08:25,199
Now,

181
00:08:25,560 --> 00:08:27,000
although Ye Xuan is also making efforts,

182
00:08:27,800 --> 00:08:29,480
he can't achieve it overnight.

183
00:08:30,399 --> 00:08:31,480
Moreover, he is fickle.

184
00:08:32,159 --> 00:08:33,159
If there is any change,

185
00:08:33,759 --> 00:08:34,799
it's hard to resist.

186
00:08:35,039 --> 00:08:36,600
The way to wake Gu Jiachen up

187
00:08:37,159 --> 00:08:39,000
is indeed recorded in the secret book.

188
00:08:42,759 --> 00:08:43,840
But

189
00:08:45,240 --> 00:08:47,279
the Soul Splitting can bring the soul back,

190
00:08:47,720 --> 00:08:48,799
but it's dangerous.

191
00:08:49,159 --> 00:08:50,320
It needs blood as a guide.

192
00:08:51,080 --> 00:08:52,600
When the main soul returns, the other souls will disappear.

193
00:08:53,360 --> 00:08:54,399
When one soul wakes up,

194
00:08:55,039 --> 00:08:56,159
the others will be quiet.

195
00:09:00,840 --> 00:09:01,799
Does that mean

196
00:09:02,600 --> 00:09:03,639
all the personalities in Gu Jiachen

197
00:09:03,679 --> 00:09:05,320
will disappear

198
00:09:06,120 --> 00:09:07,480
to wake him up?

199
00:09:12,679 --> 00:09:13,159
Sister,

200
00:09:15,639 --> 00:09:16,600
thank you for remembering me.

201
00:09:18,679 --> 00:09:19,679
Now it's time to give back

202
00:09:20,200 --> 00:09:20,960
their memories.

203
00:09:21,759 --> 00:09:22,360
Ruan Che...

204
00:09:28,080 --> 00:09:28,519
No,

205
00:09:29,120 --> 00:09:30,120
that's too selfish.

206
00:09:31,039 --> 00:09:32,519
Che is beyond redemption.

207
00:09:32,759 --> 00:09:34,080
Even for Gu Jiachen,

208
00:09:34,799 --> 00:09:35,600
we can't sacrifice

209
00:09:35,600 --> 00:09:36,559
Ye Xuan and Fu Yi.

210
00:09:37,440 --> 00:09:38,960
It's more important to do things now.

211
00:09:51,879 --> 00:09:53,320
I said no politics tonight.

212
00:09:53,720 --> 00:09:54,440
Who let you in?

213
00:10:02,759 --> 00:10:03,919
How dare you?

214
00:10:13,159 --> 00:10:13,840
Stop picking it up.

215
00:10:14,320 --> 00:10:15,639
It will be cleaned up tomorrow.

216
00:10:21,279 --> 00:10:21,919
Feng Zhiwei,

217
00:10:22,559 --> 00:10:23,399
are you deaf?

218
00:10:25,039 --> 00:10:25,679
No, I'm not.

219
00:10:26,039 --> 00:10:27,000
I just think

220
00:10:27,360 --> 00:10:28,559
it's embarrassing for a ruler

221
00:10:28,840 --> 00:10:29,919
to live like a grumpy cat.

222
00:10:30,919 --> 00:10:31,600
So embarrassing.

223
00:10:33,840 --> 00:10:34,919
Who are you calling a cat?

224
00:10:35,519 --> 00:10:36,919
You!

225
00:10:39,320 --> 00:10:40,000
Feng Zhiwei,

226
00:10:41,480 --> 00:10:43,519
although the coronation ceremony has not been held,

227
00:10:44,000 --> 00:10:45,440
but I'm the Emperor now.

228
00:10:45,720 --> 00:10:46,759
I advise you to...

229
00:10:46,759 --> 00:10:47,440
I'll go, or...

230
00:10:54,600 --> 00:10:55,759
I just took away your

231
00:10:55,759 --> 00:10:57,039
small treasury.

232
00:10:57,519 --> 00:10:58,360
Are you still mad at me?

233
00:11:02,279 --> 00:11:03,159
It has nothing to do with you.

234
00:11:03,759 --> 00:11:04,639
I'm just annoyed.

235
00:11:08,559 --> 00:11:09,159
Why?

236
00:11:10,799 --> 00:11:11,919
Do you know what they

237
00:11:12,240 --> 00:11:13,200
said about me behind my back?

238
00:11:14,120 --> 00:11:15,200
They said I was hot-tempered,

239
00:11:15,600 --> 00:11:16,759
scolding ministers at the drop of a hat,

240
00:11:17,120 --> 00:11:18,320
and had no benevolent emperor's style.

241
00:11:19,000 --> 00:11:20,080
I work on memorials

242
00:11:20,120 --> 00:11:20,879
until midnight every day,

243
00:11:21,080 --> 00:11:22,120
and these old fools

244
00:11:22,480 --> 00:11:23,519
say that about me behind my back.

245
00:11:26,080 --> 00:11:26,840
But it doesn't matter.

246
00:11:28,000 --> 00:11:29,320
I'm not doing this

247
00:11:29,759 --> 00:11:31,519
for their approval.

248
00:11:38,799 --> 00:11:39,279
You...

249
00:11:40,519 --> 00:11:41,519
Why are you here?

250
00:11:45,120 --> 00:11:45,799
In three days,

251
00:11:45,919 --> 00:11:47,440
envoys from the Huns will arrive.

252
00:11:47,639 --> 00:11:48,559
Here are their profiles,

253
00:11:48,840 --> 00:11:49,559
customs,

254
00:11:49,679 --> 00:11:50,759
and past diplomatic records.

255
00:11:52,480 --> 00:11:53,000
That's all?

256
00:11:55,480 --> 00:11:55,919
That's all.

257
00:11:57,639 --> 00:11:58,559
This concerns the northwest

258
00:11:58,720 --> 00:12:00,519
border affairs and border peace.

259
00:12:01,000 --> 00:12:01,480
Your Highness,

260
00:12:02,039 --> 00:12:03,519
you have to do it well.

261
00:12:04,000 --> 00:12:04,600
Feng Zhiwei,

262
00:12:05,399 --> 00:12:07,039
you come to me at this late hour

263
00:12:07,919 --> 00:12:09,720
just to give me homework?

264
00:12:11,720 --> 00:12:13,120
It's up to you to think so.

265
00:12:13,879 --> 00:12:14,759
Do you know

266
00:12:15,600 --> 00:12:17,039
what you look like

267
00:12:17,799 --> 00:12:18,519
when you say that?

268
00:12:20,720 --> 00:12:21,320
What?

269
00:12:24,600 --> 00:12:26,000
Like a woman in charge of me.

270
00:12:29,360 --> 00:12:30,320
You're overthinking.

271
00:12:30,720 --> 00:12:31,480
I'm just afraid that

272
00:12:31,480 --> 00:12:32,559
you'll mess this up,

273
00:12:32,799 --> 00:12:34,120
and I'll have to clean up after you.

274
00:12:37,039 --> 00:12:37,720
Tomorrow in court,

275
00:12:38,480 --> 00:12:39,320
you need to read all of this.

276
00:12:42,960 --> 00:12:44,159
I'll highlight the key points for you.

277
00:12:44,799 --> 00:12:45,639
Just follow them.

278
00:12:49,639 --> 00:12:50,200
Feng Zhiwei,

279
00:12:51,600 --> 00:12:52,440
there's still a month left

280
00:12:55,879 --> 00:12:57,440
until our March appointment.

281
00:12:58,159 --> 00:12:59,200
Don't forget it.

282
00:13:01,200 --> 00:13:01,720
I haven't forgotten.

283
00:13:02,240 --> 00:13:02,960
But you need to

284
00:13:02,960 --> 00:13:04,200
handle the envoy issue first.

285
00:13:06,039 --> 00:13:06,399
Ye Xuan,

286
00:13:07,720 --> 00:13:08,720
don't you want to prove

287
00:13:08,879 --> 00:13:10,159
that you're better than Gu Jiachen?

288
00:13:11,360 --> 00:13:12,440
Then show me.

289
00:13:13,519 --> 00:13:14,679
In your own way.

290
00:13:16,720 --> 00:13:17,399
This booklet contains

291
00:13:17,759 --> 00:13:18,919
basic greetings in the language of Wusun.

292
00:13:19,840 --> 00:13:20,600
If you want to learn,

293
00:13:21,240 --> 00:13:22,200
I'll find someone to teach you tomorrow.

